From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:27:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 204/210] videoparsers: Add avsparse and avs2parse

Add parsers that split AVS1/AVS+ (video/x-cavs) and AVS2
(video/x-avs2) elementary streams into coded pictures, one per buffer:
the picture header with its slices and the sequence header, extension
and user data units in front of it. They start at a sequence header,
mark buffers without an intra picture as delta units, and set the
size, frame rate, interlacing and profile from the sequence header in
the caps, with parsed=true.

Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
